02:43.280 --> 02:43.890
Walau bagaimanapun,

02:44.030 --> 02:45.010
Saya hampir dibunuh olehnya tadi.

02:45.750 --> 02:46.170
Maaf.

02:47.400 --> 02:48.410
Bukankah anda berkata Sarang Labah-labah

02:48.470 --> 02:49.410
